<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Bank Commerce 1996 turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Bank Commerce 1996 turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	 1.46  vs   profit    1.34</p>
<p>    Net	   loss   2,840.71  vs   profit  860.39</p>
<p>NOTES: Bangkok Bank of Commerce Plc was taken over by the government last year after the disclosure of a big non-performing loan portfolio triggered a public run on its deposits.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
